AUDIT_SAMPLE {"file": "45081113086/turbo+norm+short.json", "id": "cs-longmax", "group": "cs-long", "mode": "cs", "audio_seconds": 45.24, "audio_ctx": 1500, "applied_gain": 1, "prompt": false, "detected_language": "cs", "model_load_ms": 474.352, "inference_ms": 98132.2, "transcription_wall_seconds": 98.6583983999999, "rtf": 2.1807780371352763, "os_peak_worker_rss_bytes": 938713088, "audio_sha256": "b0def96d5af53877daf6e2c240438d233aa4e6c282449008f62a4a7b3743b867", "text": "V\u011bt\u0161ina \u017eivota hebrejsk\u00e9 rodiny se odehr\u00e1vala pod \u0161ir\u00fdm nebem. Pacient byl v Nigerii, kde se vyskytlo n\u011bkolik p\u0159\u00edpad\u016f viru Ebola. Hlavn\u00ed n\u00e1bo\u017eenstv\u00ed Moldavsk\u00e9 ortodoxn\u00ed k\u0159es\u0165anstv\u00ed. Prvn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edpady nemoci se t\u00e9to sez\u00f3n\u011b objevily na konci \u010dervence. SPF Bayonu p\u0159evzal Laka Singh. Je to martely p\u00e1t\u00e1 cep za \u010dty\u0159i roky. V\u00fdsledek vykreslovac\u00ed anal\u00fdzy bude zve\u0159ejn\u011b p\u0159\u00edstupn\u00e9m webu. V sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed n\u011bkter\u00fdch festival\u016f jsou speci\u00e1ln\u00ed kempy pro rodiny s mal\u00fdmi d\u011btmi. Policia \u0159ekla, \u017ee t\u011blo vypadalo, jako by tam bylo zhruba r\u00e9n. V\u0161udy p\u0159\u00edtomn\u00e1 s\u00edla m\u011bla vliv na ka\u017ed\u00e9ho od kr\u00e1la a\u017e k prost\u00e9mu ob\u010danovi.", "score": {"words": 95, "substitutions": 14, "deletions": 5, "insertions": 1, "characters": 610, "character_errors": 50, "cer": 0.08196721311475409, "wer": 0.21052631578947367, "hallucinated_words": 0}}
